tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["===============================================================================\n","  SECTION A UPGRADE COMPLETE: 98-BIN QUANTILE WINSORIZED TARGETS LOCKED        \n","===============================================================================\n","LONG  | Profit Bins: 95 | P98 Cap: 9.9300% | Median P50: 0.6500%\n","LONG  | Danger Bins: 98 | P98 Cap: 3.7276% | Median P50: 0.6669%\n","SHORT | Profit Bins: 97 | P98 Cap: 9.6956% | Median P50: 0.6800%\n","SHORT | Danger Bins: 98 | P98 Cap: 3.7967% | Median P50: 0.6547%\n","===============================================================================\n","\n"]}],"source":["\"\"\"\n","====================================================================================================\n","ALGORITHM: Section A.11c — 98-Bin Quantile Winsorized Target Construction & Median Binarization\n","====================================================================================================\n","Purpose:\n","  Construct continuous and binary targets for Profit and Danger using 98-bin Quantile Winsorization.\n","  All quantile edges, cutoffs, and median thresholds are computed STRICTLY on `train_ref`\n","  (train_long / train_short) to guarantee zero lookahead leakage into validation or out-of-sample splits.\n","\n","Mathematical Mechanics:\n","  1. Quantile Winsorization (98 Unique Bins):\n","     - Percentile grid: 98 evenly spaced points from 1% to 98% (np.linspace(1, 98, 98)).\n","     - Cutoffs: C = percentile(train_ref[col], grid_98).\n","     - Digitize values using the first 97 cutoffs (P1 through P97) via np.digitize(x, bins=C[:-1]).\n","     - Values exceeding P98 are clamped to bin index 97 (assigned cutoff value C[97]).\n","     - Bounding the top 2% tail protects CatBoost leaf gradient updates from flash-crash wicks.\n","  2. Binary Classification Thresholds (b50):\n","     - P50 median: median_val = percentile(train_ref[col], 50).\n","     - B