"--- Step 4: Tier 1 — 4 Global Directional Models (Global P50 Binarization) ---\n","\n","[Global Model 1/4] Optimizing target_profit_b50__LONG (Testing 12 Configurations)...\n","  --> Global target_profit_b50__LONG Locked | Arch: Funnel_3L_L30_lr0001 | Val PR-AUC: 0.7331 | OOS PR-AUC: 0.6943 | Win Rate: 68.2% (244.5s)\n","\n","[Global Model 2/4] Optimizing target_profit_b50__SHORT (Testing 12 Configurations)...\n","  --> Global target_profit_b50__SHORT Locked | Arch: Funnel_3L_L15_lr0001 | Val PR-AUC: 0.7579 | OOS PR-AUC: 0.7245 | Win Rate: 73.2% (252.0s)\n","\n","[Global Model 3/4] Optimizing target_danger_b50__LONG (Testing 12 Configurations)...\n","  --> Global target_danger_b50__LONG Locked | Arch: Funnel_2L_L30_lr00005 | Val PR-AUC: 0.8560 | OOS PR-AUC: 0.8208 | Win Rate: 77.2% (243.4s)\n","\n","[Global Model 4/4] Optimizing target_danger_b50__SHORT (Testing 12 Configurations)...\n","  --> Global target_danger_b50__SHORT Locked | Arch: Funnel_3L_L30_lr0001 | Val PR-AUC: 0.8571 | OOS PR-AUC: 0.7816 | Win Rate: 76.5% (268.9s)\n","\n","All 4 Global Funnel GRU Models Optimized & Checkpointed (1008.8s).\n","\n","--- Step 5: Tier 2 — 20 Per-Symbol Models (Symbol-Specific P50 Binarization) ---\n"]}],"source":["\"\"\"\n","====================================================================================================\n","ALGORITHM: Track 2 — 24 Funnel GRU Binary Classifiers (4 Global + 20 Symbol-Specific)\n","====================================================================================================\n","Purpose:\n","  1. Train, optimize, and checkpoint all 24 PyTorch Funnel GRU Binary Classifiers targeting:\n","       - `target_profit_b50` : Binary classification (1 if profit excursion >= P50 median, else 0).\n","       - `target_danger_b50` : Binary risk classification (1 if drawdown excursion >= P50 median, else 0).\n","  2. Enforce Strict Target Provenance & Balanced Class Discipline:\n","       - Tier 1 (4 Global Models) : Binarized at the Global Sub-Train median (P50).\n","       - Tier 2 (20 Symbol Models): Binarized STRICTLY at each symbol's own Sub-Train median (P50),\n","         guaranteeing an exact 50/50 balanced classification task per coin.\n","  3. Execute Discrete Structural Grid Search across Recurrent Dimensions:\n","       - Topologies           : Funnel-2L [64, 32] vs. Funnel-3L [64, 32, 16]\n","       - Lookback Horizons (L): L in [5, 15, 30] (Causal Symbol-Separated sequences)\n","       - Learning Rates       : 1e-3 (0.001) vs. 5e-4 (0.0005) with AdamW (weight_decay=1e-4)\n","       - Total Grid Size      : 2 Topologies x 3 Lookbacks x 2 LRs = 12 Trials per model.\n","  4. Leak-Free Validation & Early Stopping:\n","       - Inner 85% Sub-Train for gradient backpropagation; 15% Sub-Val for early stopping.\n","       - StandardScaler fitted strictly on Sub-Train features.\n","       - Model selection criterion: Maximizing Sub-Val PR-AUC (Average Precision).\n","       - Optimal weights theta* restored and evaluated once on untouched Out-of-Sample (OOS) data:\n","         PR-AUC, ROC-AUC, Win Rate (Precision at tau=0.50), Recall, F1-Score, and Brier Loss.\n","  5. Checkpointing & Master Serialization:\n","       - All 24 models checkpointed to MODELS_DIR under uniform naming:\n","         `Ema_testnet_FunnelGRU_{target}_{direction}_{symbol}_models.pt`.\n","       - Master 24-row scoreboard displayed and saved to:\n","         `RESULTS_DIR/Ema_testnet_GRU_Classification_Optimization_results.json`.\n","       - Renders vertical (3, 1) diagnostic plots.\n","\n","Algorithm Steps:\n","  1. Execution Guard & Device Verification:\n","     - Set RUN_GRU_OPTIMIZATION = True.\n","     - Validate compute device via get_robust_device() and seed torch/numpy = 42.\n","     - Confirm availability of Section A objects and shap_features_map.\n","  2. Modular Multi-Layer Funnel GRU Architecture:\n","     - Define MultiLayerFunnelGRU supporting arbitrary hidden layer lists (e.g. [64, 32], [64, 32, 16]).\n","     - Head: Linear(last_hidden, 1) returning raw unactivated logits for BCEWithLogitsLoss.\n","  3. Causal Sequence Construction Pipeline:\n","     - Define build_symbol_sequences() grouping strictly by coin symbol with front-padding.\n","  4. Tier 1 — 4 Global Directional Models (Profit & Danger x LONG & SHORT):\n","     - Target binarized at Global Sub-Train P50.\n","     - Sweep 12 configurations; select theta* maximizing Sub-Val PR-AUC.\n","     - Save to MODELS_DIR as: Ema_testnet_FunnelGRU_{target}_{dir}_GLOBAL_models.pt.\n","  5. Tier 2 — 20 Per-Symbol Dedicated Models:\n","     - For each target in [profit_b50, danger_b50]:\n","       For each direction in [LONG, SHORT]:\n","         For each symbol in [BTCUSDT, DOGEUSDT, ETHUSDT, SOLUSDT, XRPUSDT]:\n","           * Target binarized at SYMBOL-SPECIFIC Sub-Train P50 median.\n","           * Sweep 12 configurations; select theta* maximizing Sub-Val PR-AUC.\n","           * Save to MODELS_DIR as: Ema_testnet_FunnelGRU_{target}_{dir}_{symbol}_models.pt.\n","           * Evaluate on untouched symbol OOS slice: PR-AUC, ROC-AUC, Prec, Rec, F1, Brier.\n","  6. Master 24-Model Scoreboard, Vertical (3, 1) Visuals & Serialization:\n","     - Concatenate Tier 1 (4 rows) and Tier 2 (20 rows) into a single 24-row master table.\n","     - Render vertical (3, 1) diagnostic plots.\n","     - Serialize master results payload to RESULTS_DIR.\n","====================================================================================================\n","\"\"\"\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# STEP 1: Execution Guard & Device Verification\n","# =============================================================================\n","RUN_GRU_OPTIMIZATION = True\n","\n","if RUN_GRU_OPTIMIZATION:\n","    import os\n","    import copy\n","    import time\n","    import json\n","    import warnings\n","    import torch\n","    import torch.nn as nn\n","    import torch.optim as optim\n","    import numpy as np\n","    import pandas as pd\n","    import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","    from torch.utils.data import TensorDataset, DataLoader\n","    from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n","    from sklearn.metrics import (\n","        average_precision_score,\n","        roc_auc_score,\n","        precision_score,\n","        recall_score,\n","        f1_score,\n","        brier_score_loss\n","    )\n","\n","    # Hardware resilience selector\n","    def get_robust_device():\n","        if torch.cuda.is_available():\n","            try:\n","                major_cap = torch.cuda.get_device_capability()[0]\n","                if major_cap < 7:\n","                    return torch.device('cpu')\n","                t = torch.randn(2, 2, device='cuda')\n","                _ = torch.relu(t)\n","                return torch.device('cuda')\n","            except Exception:\n","                return torch.device('cpu')\n","        return torch.device('cpu')\n","\n","    DEVICE = get_robust_device()\n","    torch.manual_seed(42)\n","    np.random.seed(42)\n","\n","    # Validate dependencies from Section A and Track 1\n","    required_vars = [\n","        'train_long', 'train_short', 'oos_long', 'oos_short',\n","        'direction_train_map', 'direction_oos_map', 'MODELS_DIR', 'RESULTS_DIR'\n","    ]\n","    for var in required_vars:\n","        if var not in globals():\n","            raise RuntimeError(f\"[Dependency Error] Required variable '{var}' is missing from scope!\")\n","\n","    CLASSIFICATION_TARGETS = ['target_profit_b50', 'target_danger_b50']\n","    RAW_BASE_TARGETS       = {'target_profit_b50': 'target_profit', 'target_danger_b50': 'target_danger'}\n","    DIRECTIONS             = ['LONG', 'SHORT']\n","    ACTIVE_SYMBOLS         = ['BTCUSDT', 'DOGEUSDT', 'ETHUSDT', 'SOLUSDT', 'XRPUSDT']\n","\n","    print(\"===============================================================================\")\n","    print(\"  TRACK 2: FUNNEL GRU CLASSIFIER OPTIMIZATION SUITE (24 TOTAL MODELS)          \")\n","    print(f\"  Targets     : {CLASSIFICATION_TARGETS} (P50 Balanced Binary Hurdles)         \")\n","    print(f\"  Directions  : {DIRECTIONS} | Assets: {ACTIVE_SYMBOLS}                       \")\n","    print(f\"  Compute Device: {DEVICE} | Storage: {MODELS_DIR}                             \")\n","    print(\"===============================================================================\\n\")\n","\n","    # Fallback check for SHAP features map (extract if not in memory from Track 1)\n","    if 'shap_features_map' not in globals() or not shap_features_map:\n","        import lightgbm as lgb\n","        import shap\n","        print(\"--- [Notice] Re-extracting Target-Specific SHAP-16 Sets on Sub-Train ---\")\n","        shap_features_map = {'target_profit_v1': {}, 'target_danger_v1': {}}\n","        for t_col in ['target_profit_v1', 'target_danger_v1']:\n","            for dir_val in DIRECTIONS:\n","                df_tr_dir, feats_all_dir = direction_train_map[dir_val]\n","                clean_tr = df_tr_dir[['checked_at_utc', t_col] + feats_all_dir].replace([np.inf, -np.inf], np.nan).dropna().sort_values('checked_at_utc').reset_index(drop=True)\n","                sub_size = int(len(clean_tr) * 0.85)\n","                df_sub   = clean_tr.iloc[:sub_size].reset_index(drop=True)\n","\n","                lgb_reg = lgb.LGBMRegressor(n_estimators=100, learning_rate=0.05, random_state=42, verbose=-1, n_jobs=-1)\n","                lgb_reg.fit(df_sub[feats_all_dir], df_sub[t_col])\n","\n","                with warnings.catch_warnings():\n","                    warnings.filterwarnings(\"ignore\", category=UserWarning)\n","                    exp = shap.TreeExplainer(lgb_reg)\n","                    s_matrix = exp.shap_values(df_sub[feats_all_dir])\n","\n","                mean_shap = np.abs(s_matrix).mean(axis=0)\n","                s_ranks   = pd.Series(mean_shap, index=feats_all_dir).sort_values(ascending=False)\n","                shap_features_map[t_col][dir_val] = list(s_ranks.head(16).index)\n","\n","    # =========================================================================\n","    # STEP 2: Modular Multi-Layer Funnel GRU Architecture Definition\n","    # =========================================================================\n","    class MultiLayerFunnelGRU(nn.Module):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        Stacked Funnel GRU Classifier:\n","          Input (16) -> GRU(h_1) -> GRU(h_2) -> ... -> Linear(last_h, 1)\n","        Outputs raw unactivated linear logits for numerical stability with BCEWithLogitsLoss.\n","        \"\"\"\n","        def __init__(self, input_dim: int, hidden_dims: list):\n","            super(MultiLayerFunnelGRU, self).__init__()\n","            self.input_dim = input_dim\n","            self.hidden_dims = hidden_dims\n","            \n","            self.layers = nn.ModuleList()\n","            in_d = input_dim\n","            for h_d in hidden_dims:\n","                self.layers.append(nn.GRU(input_size=in_d, hidden_size=h_d, batch_first=True))\n","                in_d = h_d\n","                \n","            self.head = nn.Linear(hidden_dims[-1], 1)\n","\n","        def forward(self, x: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:\n","            curr = x\n","            for layer in self.layers:\n","                curr, h_n = layer(curr)\n","            final_hidden = h_n.squeeze(0)\n","            return self.head(final_hidden)\n","\n","    # =========================================================================\n","    # STEP 3: Causal Sequence Window Builder\n","    # =========================================================================\n","    def build_causal_sequences(scaled_feats, target_array, seq_len):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        Builds causal sliding sequence windows with causal front-padding.\n","        Output shape: (N, seq_len, num_features).\n","        \"\"\"\n","        n = len(scaled_feats)\n","        all_X, all_y = [], []\n","\n","        for i in range(n):\n","            if i + 1 < seq_len:\n","                pad = seq_len - (i + 1)\n","                window = np.vstack([np.tile(scaled_feats[0], (pad, 1)), scaled_feats[:i + 1]])\n","            else:\n","                window = scaled_feats[i - seq_len + 1 : i + 1]\n","\n","            all_X.append(window)\n","            all_y.append(target_array[i])\n","\n","        X_t = torch.tensor(np.array(all_X, dtype=np.float32), dtype=torch.float32)\n","        y_t = torch.tensor(np.array(all_y, dtype=np.float32).reshape(-1, 1), dtype=torch.float32)\n","        return X_t, y_t\n","\n","    # Define the 12 candidate configurations in the search grid\n","    RECURRENT_SEARCH_GRID = []\n","    for topo_name, h_dims in [('Funnel_2L', [64, 32]), ('Funnel_3L', [64, 32, 16])]:\n","        for s_len in [5, 15, 30]:\n","            for lr_val in [1e-3, 5e-4]:\n","                RECURRENT_SEARCH_GRID.append({\n","                    'tag': f\"{topo_name}_L{s_len}_lr{str(lr_val).replace('.','')}\",\n","                    'hidden_dims': h_dims,\n","                    'seq_len': s_len,\n","                    'lr': lr_val\n","                })\n","\n","    print(f\"Recurrent Grid Configured: {len(RECURRENT_SEARCH_GRID)} configurations per model instance.\\n\")\n","\n","    # =========================================================================\n","    # STEP 4: Tier 1 — 4 Global Directional Models (Global P50 Binarization)\n","    # =========================================================================\n","    print(\"--- Step 4: Tier 1 — 4 Global Directional Models (Global P50 Binarization) ---\")\n","\n","    global_gru_summaries = []\n","    global_gru_winning_configs = {}\n","    global_model_counter = 0\n","\n","    t_tier1_start = time.perf_counter()\n","\n","    for t_col in CLASSIFICATION_TARGETS:\n","        raw_t_col = RAW_BASE_TARGETS[t_col]\n","        shap_key  = 'target_profit_v1' if 'profit' in t_col else 'target_danger_v1'\n","\n","        for dir_val in DIRECTIONS:\n","            global_model_counter += 1\n","            combo_tag = f\"{t_col}__{dir_val}\"\n","            df_tr_dir, _  = direction_train_map[dir_val]\n","            df_oos_dir, _ = direction_oos_map[dir_val]\n","            f_s16 = shap_features_map[shap_key][dir_val]\n","\n","            print(f\"\\n[Global Model {global_model_counter}/4] Optimizing {combo_tag} (Testing 12 Configurations)...\")\n","            t_g_start = time.perf_counter()\n","\n","            # Clean and sort chronologically\n","            cols_needed = list(set(['checked_at_utc', raw_t_col] + f_s16))\n","            clean_tr  = df_tr_dir[cols_needed].replace([np.inf, -np.inf], np.nan).dropna().sort_values('checked_at_utc').reset_index(drop=True)\n","            clean_oos = df_oos_dir[cols_needed].replace([np.inf, -np.inf], np.nan).dropna().sort_values('checked_at_utc').reset_index(drop=True)\n","\n","            sub_size = int(len(clean_tr) * 0.85)\n","            df_sub_tr  = clean_tr.iloc[:sub_size].reset_index(drop=True)\n","            df_sub_val = clean_tr.iloc[sub_size:].reset_index(drop=True)\n","\n","            # Global P50 Cutoff strictly computed on Sub-Train\n","            global_p50 = float(np.percentile(df_sub_tr[raw_t_col].dropna(), 50))\n","            y_sub_tr_b  = (df_sub_tr[raw_t_col]  >= global_p50).astype(np.float32).values\n","            y_sub_val_b = (df_sub_val[raw_t_col] >= global_p50).astype(np.float32).values\n","            y_oos_b     = (clean_oos[raw_t_col]   >= global_p50).astype(np.float32).values\n","\n","            scaler_g = StandardScaler()\n","            X_tr_sc  = scaler_g.fit_transform(df_sub_tr[f_s16].values.astype(np.float32))\n","            X_val_sc = scaler_g.transform(df_sub_val[f_s16].values.astype(np.float32))\n","            X_oos_sc = scaler_g.transform(clean_oos[f_s16].values.astype(np.float32))\n","\n","            best_val_score   = -1.0\n","            best_config_meta = None\n","            best_model_state = None\n","            best_epoch_saved = 0\n","\n","            # Evaluate 12 discrete configurations\n","            for cand in RECURRENT_SEARCH_GRID:\n","                s_len  = cand['seq_len']\n","                h_dims = cand['hidden_dims']\n","                lr_val = cand['lr']\n","\n","                X_tr_t,  y_tr_t  = build_causal_sequences(X_tr_sc,  y_sub_tr_b,  s_len)\n","                X_val_t, y_val_t = build_causal_sequences(X_val_sc, y_sub_val_b, s_len)\n","\n","                train_loader = DataLoader(TensorDataset(X_tr_t, y_tr_t),   batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\n","                val_loader   = DataLoader(TensorDataset(X_val_t, y_val_t), batch_size=256, shuffle=False)\n","\n","                model = MultiLayerFunnelGRU(input_dim=16, hidden_dims=h_dims).to(DEVICE)\n","                criterion = nn.BCEWithLogitsLoss()\n","                optimizer = optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=lr_val, weight_decay=1e-4)\n","\n","                best_v_loss = float('inf')\n","                p_cnt = 0\n","                temp_best_state = None\n","                temp_best_epoch = 0\n","\n","                for epoch in range(1, 81):\n","                    model.train()\n","                    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n","                        xb, yb = xb.to(DEVICE), yb.to(DEVICE)\n","                        optimizer.zero_grad()\n","                        logits = model(xb)\n","                        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n","                        loss.backward()\n","                        optimizer.step()\n","\n","                    model.eval()\n","                    v_loss, v_cnt = 0.0, 0\n","                    with torch.no_grad():\n","                        for xb, yb in val_loader:\n","                            xb, yb = xb.to(DEVICE), yb.to(DEVICE)\n","                            v_logits = model(xb)\n","                            v_loss += criterion(v_logits, yb).item() * xb.size(0)\n","                            v_cnt += xb.size(0)\n","\n","                    avg_v_loss = v_loss / v_cnt\n","                    if avg_v_loss < best_v_loss:\n","                        best_v_loss = avg_v_loss\n","                        temp_best_epoch = epoch\n","                        temp_best_state = copy.deepcopy(model.state_dict())\n","                        p_cnt = 0\n","                    else:\n","                        p_cnt += 1\n","\n","                    if p_cnt >= 15:\n","                        break\n","\n","                # Restore checkpoint and evaluate Sub-Val PR-AUC\n","                model.load_state_dict(temp_best_state)\n","                model.eval()\n","\n","                with torch.no_grad():\n","                    val_logits = model(X_val_t.to(DEVICE))\n","                    val_probs  = torch.sigmoid(val_logits).cpu().numpy().flatten()\n","\n","                val_pr_auc = float(average_precision_score(y_sub_val_b.astype(int), val_probs))\n","\n","                if val_pr_auc > best_val_score:\n","                    best_val_score   = val_pr_auc\n","                    best_config_meta = cand\n","                    best_model_state = copy.deepcopy(temp_best_state)\n","                    best_epoch_saved = temp_best_epoch\n","\n","            global_gru_winning_configs[combo_tag] = best_config_meta\n","\n","            # Save Global Model Checkpoint (.pt)\n","            global_model_name = f\"Ema_testnet_FunnelGRU_{t_col}_{dir_val}_GLOBAL_models.pt\"\n","            global_model_path = os.path.join(MODELS_DIR, global_model_name)\n","\n","            winning_model = MultiLayerFunnelGRU(input_dim=16, hidden_dims=best_config_meta['hidden_dims']).to(DEVICE)\n","            winning_model.load_state_dict(best_model_state)\n","            torch.save(winning_model.state_dict(), global_model_path)\n","\n","            # Evaluate on untouched OOS (Blind 1-Touch)\n","            winning_s_len = best_config_meta['seq_len']\n","            X_oos_t, y_oos_t = build_causal_sequences(X_oos_sc, y_oos_b, winning_s_len)\n","\n","            winning_model.eval()\n","            with torch.no_grad():\n","                oos_logits = winning_model(X_oos_t.to(DEVICE))\n","                oos_probs  = torch.sigmoid(oos_logits).cpu().numpy().flatten()\n","\n","            y_oos_true = y_oos_b.astype(int)\n","            y_oos_pred = (oos_probs >= 0.50).astype(int)\n","\n","            oos_pr_auc = float(average_precision_score(y_oos_true, oos_probs))\n","            oos_roc    = float(roc_auc_score(y_oos_true, oos_probs))\n","            oos_prec   = float(precision_score(y_oos_true, y_oos_pred, zero_division=0))\n","            oos_rec    = float(recall_score(y_oos_true, y_oos_pred, zero_division=0))\n","            oos_f1     = float(f1_score(y_oos_true, y_oos_pred, zero_division=0))\n","            oos_brier  = float(brier_score_loss(y_oos_true, oos_probs))\n","\n","            elapsed_g = time.perf_counter() - t_g_start\n","\n","            record_g = {\n","                'model_tier': 'GLOBAL',\n","                'target': t_col,\n","                'direction': dir_val,\n","                'symbol': 'GLOBAL',\n","                'best_config': best_config_meta['tag'],\n","                'hidden_dims': str(best_config_meta['hidden_dims']),\n","                'seq_len': best_config_meta['seq_len'],\n","                'learning_rate': best_config_meta['lr'],\n","                'best_epoch': best_epoch_saved,\n","                'sub_val_pr_auc': round(best_val_score, 4),\n","                'oos_samples': len(y_oos_true),\n","                'base_rate': round(float(np.mean(y_oos_true)), 4),\n","                'oos_pr_auc': round(oos_pr_auc, 4),\n","                'oos_roc_auc': round(oos_roc, 4),\n","                'win_rate_prec': round(oos_prec, 4),\n","                'recall': round(oos_rec, 4),\n","                'f1_score': round(oos_f1, 4),\n","                'brier_loss': round(oos_brier, 4),\n","                'checkpoint_file': global_model_name\n","            }\n","            global_gru_summaries.append(record_g)\n","\n","            print(f\"  --> Global {combo_tag} Locked | Arch: {best_config_meta['tag']} | Val PR-AUC: {best_val_score:.4f} | OOS PR-AUC: {oos_pr_auc:.4f} | Win Rate: {oos_prec*100:.1f}% ({elapsed_g:.1f}s)\")\n","\n","    print(f\"\\nAll 4 Global Funnel GRU Models Optimized & Checkpointed ({time.perf_counter() - t_tier1_start:.1f}s).\\n\")\n","\n","    # =========================================================================\n","    # STEP 5: Tier 2 — 20 Per-Symbol Models (Symbol-Specific P50 Binarization)\n","    # =========================================================================\n","    print(\"--- Step 5: Tier 2 — 20 Per-Symbol Models (Symbol-Specific P50 Binarization) ---\")\n","\n","    symbol_gru_summaries = []\n","    symbol_gru_registry  = {}\n","    symbol_model_counter = 0\n","\n","    t_tier2_start = time.perf_counter()\n","\n","    for t_col in CLASSIFICATION_TARGETS:\n","        raw_t_col = RAW_BASE_TARGETS[t_col]\n","        shap_key  = 'target_profit_v1' if 'profit' in t_col else 'target_danger_v1'\n","\n","        for dir_val in DIRECTIONS:\n","            df_tr_dir, _  = direction_train_map[dir_val]\n","            df_oos_dir, _ = direction_oos_map[dir_val]\n","            f_s16 = shap_features_map[shap_key][dir_val]\n","\n","            for sym in ACTIVE_SYMBOLS:\n","                symbol_model_counter += 1\n","                inst_key = f\"{t_col}__{dir_val}__{sym}\"\n","                t_sym_start = time.perf_counter()\n","\n","                # Slice symbol-specific data\n","                cols_needed = list(set(['checked_at_utc', raw_t_col] + f_s16))\n","                df_sym_tr  = df_tr_dir[df_tr_dir['symbol'] == sym][cols_needed].replace([np.inf, -np.inf], np.nan).dropna().sort_values('checked_at_utc').reset_index(drop=True)\n","                df_sym_oos = df_oos_dir[df_oos_dir['symbol'] == sym][cols_needed].replace([np.inf, -np.inf], np.nan).dropna().sort_values('checked_at_utc').reset_index(drop=True)\n","\n","                if len(df_sym_tr) < 50 or len(df_sym_oos) < 10:\n","                    print(f\"  [{symbol_model_counter:2d}/20] Skipped {inst_key}: Insufficient samples.\")\n","                    continue\n","\n","                sub_size = int(len(df_sym_tr) * 0.85)\n","                df_sub_tr  = df_sym_tr.iloc[:sub_size].reset_index(drop=True)\n","                df_sub_val = df_sym_tr.iloc[sub_size:].reset_index(drop=True)\n","\n","                # SYMBOL-SPECIFIC P50 MEDIAN (Exact 50/50 Balanced Prior per Coin)\n","                sym_p50 = float(np.percentile(df_sub_tr[raw_t_col].dropna(), 50))\n","                y_sub_tr_b  = (df_sub_tr[raw_t_col]  >= sym_p50).astype(np.float32).values\n","                y_sub_val_b = (df_sub_val[raw_t_col] >= sym_p50).astype(np.float32).values\n","                y_oos_b     = (df_sym_oos[raw_t_col] >= sym_p50).astype(np.float32).values\n","\n","                scaler_s = StandardScaler()\n","                X_tr_sc  = scaler_s.fit_transform(df_sub_tr[f_s16].values.astype(np.float32))\n","                X_val_sc = scaler_s.transform(df_sub_val[f_s16].values.astype(np.float32))\n","                X_oos_sc = scaler_s.transform(df_sym_oos[f_s16].values.astype(np.float32))\n","\n","                best_val_score   = -1.0\n","                best_config_meta = None\n","                best_model_state = None\n","                best_epoch_saved = 0\n","\n","                # Evaluate 12 discrete configurations\n","                for cand in RECURRENT_SEARCH_GRID:\n","                    s_len  = cand['seq_len']\n","                    h_dims = cand['hidden_dims']\n","                    lr_val = cand['lr']\n","\n","                    X_tr_t,  y_tr_t  = build_causal_sequences(X_tr_sc,  y_sub_tr_b,  s_len)\n","                    X_val_t, y_val_t = build_causal_sequences(X_val_sc, y_sub_val_b, s_len)\n","\n","                    train_loader = DataLoader(TensorDataset(X_tr_t, y_tr_t),   batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\n","                    val_loader   = DataLoader(TensorDataset(X_val_t, y_val_t), batch_size=256, shuffle=False)\n","\n","                    model = MultiLayerFunnelGRU(input_dim=16, hidden_dims=h_dims).to(DEVICE)\n","                    criterion = nn.BCEWithLogitsLoss()\n","                    optimizer = optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=lr_val, weight_decay=1e-4)\n","\n","                    best_v_loss = float('inf')\n","                    p_cnt = 0\n","                    temp_best_state = None\n","                    temp_best_epoch = 0\n","\n","                    for epoch in range(1, 81):\n","                        model.train()\n","                        for xb, yb in train_loader:\n","                            xb, yb = xb.to(DEVICE), yb.to(DEVICE)\n","                            optimizer.zero_grad()\n","                            logits = model(xb)\n","                            loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n","                            loss.backward()\n","                            optimizer.step()\n","\n","                        model.eval()\n","                        v_loss, v_cnt = 0.0, 0\n","                        with torch.no_grad():\n","                            for xb, yb in val_loader:\n","                                xb, yb = xb.to(DEVICE), yb.to(DEVICE)\n","                                v_logits = model(xb)\n","                                v_loss += criterion(v_logits, yb).item() * xb.size(0)\n","                                v_cnt += xb.size(0)\n","\n","                        avg_v_loss = v_loss / v_cnt\n","                        if avg_v_loss < best_v_loss:\n","                            best_v_loss = avg_v_loss\n","                            temp_best_epoch = epoch\n","                            temp_best_state = copy.deepcopy(model.state_dict())\n","                            p_cnt = 0\n","                        else:\n","                            p_cnt += 1\n","\n","                        if p_cnt >= 15:\n","                            break\n","\n","                    model.load_state_dict(temp_best_state)\n","                    model.eval()\n","\n","                    with torch.no_grad():\n","                        val_logits = model(X_val_t.to(DEVICE))\n","                        val_probs  = torch.sigmoid(val_logits).cpu().numpy().flatten()\n","\n","                    val_pr_auc = float(average_precision_score(y_sub_val_b.astype(int), val_probs))\n","\n","                    if val_pr_auc > best_val_score:\n","                        best_val_score   = val_pr_auc\n","                        best_config_meta = cand\n","                        best_model_state = copy.deepcopy(temp_best_state)\n","                        best_epoch_saved = temp_best_epoch\n","\n","                # Save Symbol Model Checkpoint (.pt)\n","                sym_model_name = f\"Ema_testnet_FunnelGRU_{t_col}_{dir_val}_{sym}_models.pt\"\n","                sym_model_path = os.path.join(MODELS_DIR, sym_model_name)\n","\n","                winning_model = MultiLayerFunnelGRU(input_dim=16, hidden_dims=best_config_meta['hidden_dims']).to(DEVICE)\n","                winning_model.load_state_dict(best_model_state)\n","                torch.save(winning_model.state_dict(), sym_model_path)\n","\n","                # Out-of-Sample Evaluation\n","                winning_s_len = best_config_meta['seq_len']\n","                X_oos_t, y_oos_t = build_causal_sequences(X_oos_sc, y_oos_b, winning_s_len)\n","\n","                winning_model.eval()\n","                with torch.no_grad():\n","                    oos_logits = winning_model(X_oos_t.to(DEVICE))\n","                    oos_probs  = torch.sigmoid(oos_logits).cpu().numpy().flatten()\n","\n","                y_oos_true = y_oos_b.astype(int)\n","                y_oos_pred = (oos_probs >= 0.50).astype(int)\n","\n","                oos_pr_auc = float(average_precision_score(y_oos_true, oos_probs)) if len(np.unique(y_oos_true)) > 1 else 0.5\n","                oos_roc    = float(roc_auc_score(y_oos_true, oos_probs)) if len(np.unique(y_oos_true)) > 1 else 0.5"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"efdb2ec7","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.005095,"end_time":"2026-09-06T21:05:01.937334+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-06T21:05:01.932239+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["--- \n","### Stress testing the new repo"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":6,"id":"1ff5f326","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-09-06T21:05:01.949264Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-09-06T21:05:01.948323Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-09-06T21:05:05.92945Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-09-06T21:05:05.928036Z"},"jupyter":{"source_hidden":true},"papermill":{"duration":3.989562,"end_time":"2026-09-06T21:05:05.931653+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-06T21:05:01.942091+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["===============================================================================\n","  PRE-FLIGHT REPOSITORY & HYPERPARAMETER AUDIT: ema_testnet                    \n","  Target Repository : https://github.com/Jeshurun-B/ema_testnet.git     \n","  Local Path        : /kaggle/working/ema_testnet                                              \n","===============================================================================\n","\n","--- Step 1 & 2: Testing Git Remote Authentication & Auto-Push Capability ---\n","Cloning ema_testnet into /kaggle/working...\n","Repository cloned successfully.\n","Active Git Branch Detected: 'main'\n","Remote Pull Status: Clean sync.\n","Canary probe committed and pushed successfully to GitHub.\n","Canary cleanup committed and pushed. Repository left clean.\n","\n","--- Step 3: Auditing Modular Directory Tree & Write Permissions ---\n","  [Directory Verified] models/catboost                (Read/Write/Delete OK)\n","  [Directory Verified] models/neural_nets             (Read/Write/Delete OK)\n","  [Directory Verified] Training_notebooks             (Read/Write/Delete OK)\n","  [Directory Verified] Optimal_hyperparameters        (Read/Write/Delete OK)\n","\n","--- Step 4: Auditing Hyperparameter Schemas in Optimal_hyperparameters/ ---\n","  CatBoost File Found: ema_testnet/Optimal_hyperparameters/Ema_testnet_CatBoost_Regression_Optimization_results.json\n","    - Global Models Found        : 4 / 4\n","    - Symbol Models Found        : 20 / 20\n","  Funnel GRU File Found: ema_testnet/Optimal_hyperparameters/Ema_testnet_FunnelGRU_Classification_Optimization_results.json\n","    - Global Models Found        : 4 / 4\n","    - Symbol Models Found        : 20 / 20\n","\n","===============================================================================\n","                 PRE-FLIGHT INTEGRATION AUDIT SCOREBOARD                       \n","===============================================================================\n","  [✓] Git Clone                           : PASS\n","  [✓] Branch Detection                    : PASS (main)\n","  [✓] Git Push/Pull Canary                : PASS\n","  [✓] Modular Folders Permissions         : PASS\n","  [✓] CatBoost 24-Model Schema            : PASS\n","  [✓] Funnel GRU 24-Model Schema          : PASS\n","===============================================================================\n","\n",">>> VERDICT: [PASS] REPOSITORY IS FULLY ARMED AND READY FOR 48-MODEL TRAINING <<<\n","  - Git remote push authentication verified.\n","  - Modular folders (models/catboost/ & models/neural_nets/) are writable.\n","  - All 48 model hyperparameter schemas are intact and validated.\n"]}],"source":["\"\"\"\n","====================================================================================================\n","ALGORITHM: Pre-Flight Repository & Hyperparameter Audit (ema_testnet)\n","====================================================================================================\n","Purpose:\n","  Conduct an exhaustive, non-destructive integration audit on the new `ema_testnet` repository\n","  before training and saving the 48 production models. Verifies Git token authentication, remote\n","  push capability, active branch detection, modular directory write permissions, and hyperparameter\n","  schema completeness for all 24 CatBoost and 24 Funnel GRU models.\n","\n","Components Audited:\n","  1. Git Authentication & Remote Sync:\n","     - Clones or verifies access to https://github.com/Jeshurun-B/ema_testnet.git using GITHUB_TOKEN.\n","     - Dynamically resolves the active remote tracking branch ('main' vs. 'master').\n","     - Executes an automated end-to-end canary push: writes `canary_test.json`, stages, commits,\n","       pushes to remote origin, verifies zero unpushed commits, and removes the canary cleanly.\n","  2. Modular Directory Structure:\n","     - Audits existence and verifies write/read/delete permissions for:\n","         * `models/catboost/`     (Destination for 24 .cbm regression models)\n","         * `models/neural_nets/`  (Destination for 24 .pt classification checkpoints)\n","         * `Training_notebooks/`           (Destination for production testnet execution notebooks)\n","         * `Optimal_hyperparameters/` (Repository source for locked hyperparameter JSONs)\n","  3. Hyperparameter Schema & 48-Model Inventory Audit:\n","     - Ingests `Optimal_hyperparameters/Ema_testnet_CatBoost_Regression_Optimization_results.json`:\n","         * Asserts presence of 4 Global Directional Models.\n","         * Asserts presence of 20 Symbol-Specific Dedicated Models (5 assets x 2 dirs x 2 targets).\n","         * Validates required hyperparameters (`depth`, `learning_rate`, `l2_leaf_reg`).\n","     - Ingests `Optimal_hyperparameters/Ema_testnet_FunnelGRU_Classification_Optimization_results.json`:\n","         * Asserts presence of 4 Global Directional Models.\n","         * Asserts presence of 20 Symbol-Specific Dedicated Models.\n","         * Validates required hyperparameters (`topology`, `seq_len`, `learning_rate`, `sym_p50_cutoff`).\n","  4. Pre-Flight Checklist & Verdict Formulation:\n","     - Displays a formatted ASCII verification matrix and logs an explicit PASS / FAIL verdict.\n","\n","Algorithm Steps:\n","  1. Execution Guard & Environment Validation:\n","     - Set boolean flag RUN_REPO_PREFLIGHT_AUDIT = True.\n","     - Detect Kaggle secrets or environment variables for GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_USERNAME.\n","     - Define REPO_NAME = \"ema_testnet\" and construct absolute paths.\n","  2. Git Remote Detection & Canary Push Probe:\n","     - Verify local repository presence; clone via authenticated HTTPS URL if missing.\n","     - Detect active branch dynamically via `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD`.\n","     - Write temporary canary file: `Optimal_hyperparameters/canary_test.json`.\n","     - Commit and push to origin; assert returncode == 0.\n","     - Remove canary file, commit cleanup, and push to restore clean repository state.\n","  3. Modular Directory Tree & Permission Stress Test:\n","     - Traverse all 4 target directories (`models/catboost/`, `models/neural_nets/`,\n","       `notebooks/`, `Optimal_hyperparameters/`).\n","     - Ensure directory creation and perform byte write/read/delete tests in each folder.\n","  4. Hyperparameter Schema & 48-Model Inventory Audit:\n","     - Parse both JSON files inside `Optimal_hyperparameters/`.\n","     - Verify that all 48 models (4 Global + 20 Symbol CatBoost, 4 Global + 20 Symbol GRU)\n","       possess valid, non-empty hyperparameter payloads.\n","  5. Checklist Output & Verdict:\n","     - Output consolidated status table and confirmation message.\n","====================================================================================================\n","\"\"\"\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# STEP 1: Execution Guard & Environment Validation\n","# =============================================================================\n","RUN_REPO_PREFLIGHT_AUDIT = True\n","\n","if RUN_REPO_PREFLIGHT_AUDIT:\n","    import os\n","    import time\n","    import json\n","    import subprocess as sp\n","\n","    # Identity & Repository Constants\n","    REPO_NAME       = \"ema_testnet\"\n","    GITHUB_USERNAME = \"Jeshurun-B\"\n","    PARENT_DIR      = os.getcwd()\n","    REPO_PATH       = os.path.join(PARENT_DIR, REPO_NAME)\n","\n","    # Token Retrieval\n","    IS_KAGGLE = 'KAGGLE_KERNEL_RUN_TYPE' in os.environ\n","    if IS_KAGGLE:\n","        from kaggle_secrets import UserSecretsClient\n","        secrets = UserSecretsClient()\n","        GITHUB_TOKEN = secrets.get_secret(\"GITHUB_TOKEN\").strip()\n","    else:\n","        GITHUB_TOKEN = os.environ.get(\"GITHUB_TOKEN\", \"\").strip()\n","\n","    if not GITHUB_TOKEN:\n","        raise RuntimeError(\"[FATAL] GITHUB_TOKEN is missing! Add it to Kaggle Secrets before running.\")\n","\n","    def _scrub(text: str, token: str) -> str:\n","        \"\"\"Sanitizes sensitive Git access tokens from console logs.\"\"\"\n","        return text.replace(token, \"***\") if token else text\n","\n","    print(\"===============================================================================\")\n","    print(\"  PRE-FLIGHT REPOSITORY & HYPERPARAMETER AUDIT: ema_testnet                    \")\n","    print(f\"  Target Repository : https://github.com/{GITHUB_USERNAME}/{REPO_NAME}.git     \")\n","    print(f\"  Local Path        : {REPO_PATH}                                              \")\n","    print(\"===============================================================================\\n\")\n","\n","    audit_checklist = {}\n","\n","    # =========================================================================\n","    # STEP 2: Git Remote Detection & Canary Push Probe\n","    # =========================================================================\n","    print(\"--- Step 1 & 2: Testing Git Remote Authentication & Auto-Push Capability ---\")\n","\n","    # 1. Clone repository if not present locally\n","    if not os.path.exists(REPO_PATH):\n","        remote_url = f\"https://{GITHUB_USERNAME}:{GITHUB_TOKEN}@github.com/{GITHUB_USERNAME}/{REPO_NAME}.git\"\n","        print(f\"Cloning {REPO_NAME} into {PARENT_DIR}...\")\n","        os.chdir(PARENT_DIR)\n","        clone_res = sp.run([\"git\", \"clone\", remote_url], capture_output=True, text=True)\n","        if clone_res.returncode != 0:\n","            print(\"[ERROR] Git Clone Failed:\")\n","            print(_scrub(clone_res.stderr, GITHUB_TOKEN))\n","            audit_checklist['Git Clone'] = 'FAIL'\n","            raise RuntimeError(f\"Could not clone repository {REPO_NAME}.\")\n","        print(\"Repository cloned successfully.\")\n","        audit_checklist['Git Clone'] = 'PASS'\n","    else:\n","        print(f\"Repository directory already exists at: {REPO_PATH}\")\n","        audit_checklist['Git Clone'] = 'PASS (Existing)'\n","\n","    os.chdir(REPO_PATH)\n","\n","    # 2. Configure Git identity locally\n","    sp.run([\"git\", \"config\", \"user.email\", \"israelbajulaye@student.oauife.edu.ng\"], check=True)\n","    sp.run([\"git\", \"config\", \"user.name\", GITHUB_USERNAME], check=True)\n","\n","    # 3. Detect active tracking branch ('main' vs 'master')\n","    branch_res = sp.run([\"git\", \"rev-parse\", \"--abbrev-ref\", \"HEAD\"], capture_output=True, text=True, check=True)\n","    active_branch = branch_res.stdout.strip() or \"main\"\n","    print(f\"Active Git Branch Detected: '{active_branch}'\")\n","    audit_checklist['Branch Detection'] = f\"PASS ({active_branch})\"\n","\n","    # 4. Pull latest remote state\n","    pull_res = sp.run([\"git\", \"pull\", \"origin\", active_branch, \"--no-rebase\"], capture_output=True, text=True)\n","    print(\"Remote Pull Status: Clean sync.\")\n","\n","    # 5. Write Canary Probe File\n","    canary_dir  = os.path.join(REPO_PATH, \"Optimal_hyperparameters\")\n","    os.makedirs(canary_dir, exist_ok=True)\n","    canary_file = os.path.join(canary_dir, \"canary_test.json\")\n","\n","    canary_payload = {\n","        'probe': 'Pre-flight repository write check',\n","        'timestamp_utc': time.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S', time.gmtime()),\n","        'authenticated_user': GITHUB_USERNAME,\n","        'status': 'VERIFIED'\n","    }\n","\n","    with open(canary_file, 'w') as f:\n","        json.dump(canary_payload, f, indent=2)\n","\n","    # 6. Commit and Push Canary Probe\n","    sp.run([\"git\", \"add\", canary_file], check=True)\n","    sp.run([\"git\", \"commit\", \"-m\", \"Pre-Flight: Canary authentication test\"], capture_output=True)\n","\n","    push_res = sp.run([\"git\", \"push\", \"origin\", active_branch], capture_output=True, text=True)\n","    if push_res.returncode != 0:\n","        print(\"[ERROR] Git Push Failed:\")\n","        print(_scrub(push_res.stderr, GITHUB_TOKEN))\n","        audit_checklist['Git Push/Pull Canary'] = 'FAIL'\n","        raise RuntimeError(\"GitHub Token lacks write permissions or branch protection blocked the push!\")\n","    \n","    print(\"Canary probe committed and pushed successfully to GitHub.\")\n","\n","    # 7. Cleanup Canary File from Remote\n","    if os.path.exists(canary_file):\n","        os.remove(canary_file)\n","    sp.run([\"git\", \"add\", canary_file], check=True)\n","    sp.run([\"git\", \"commit\", \"-m\", \"Pre-Flight: Canary probe cleanup\"], capture_output=True)\n","    sp.run([\"git\", \"push\", \"origin\", active_branch], capture_output=True, text=True)\n","    print(\"Canary cleanup committed and pushed. Repository left clean.\")\n","    audit_checklist['Git Push/Pull Canary'] = 'PASS'\n","\n","    # =========================================================================\n","    # STEP 3: Modular Directory Tree & Permission Audit\n","    # ===============================